<title>SAN MARINO: SOCCER-NETHERLANDS BEAT SAN MARINO 7-0 IN U-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NETHERLANDS BEAT SAN MARINO 7-0 IN U-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARINO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands beat San Marino 7-0 (halftime 4-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group seven qualifier on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Musampa 8, 83, Van Der Bergh 24, Wooters 25, Bruggink 41, Makaai 54, Van Der Doelen 69</p>
<p>	Standings	   P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> 1. Netherlands	   6   4   1   1  18   3   13</p>
<p> 2. Wales		   6   4   0   2   9   5   12</p>
<p> 3. Turkey		  5   3   0   2   9   4    9</p>
<p> 4. Belgium		 5   2   1   2  10   7    7</p>
<p> 5. San Marino	    6   0   0   6   1  28    0</p>
</text>
